+
+          <h3>Visiting the Farms</h3>
+          <p>
+            Each year, members of our roasting team travel to origin during harvest season. We walk the rows with
+            the growers, taste cherries straight off the branch, and watch how they're picked, sorted, and
+            processed. These visits teach us things a spec sheet never could: how altitude and shade cover shape a
+            lot's flavor, how a sudden rainstorm can change drying times, and what each farm's biggest challenges
